Hello Pieter,

The HX-300 is limited to 16 bar maximum system pressure, so it should not be selected for a 17 bar requirement. The HX-400 supports up to 20 bar and also covers the stated temperature and flow conditions.

Our previous technical-commercial proposal therefore used an HX-400 with FKM seal, subject to final duty-point validation.

